and Parisi, Saverio Giuseppe and Castelli, Francesco and Quiros-Roldan, Maria Eugenia and Magro, Paola and Minardi, Cristina and Castelli, Deborah and Polesini, Itala and Della Monica, Matteo and Piscopo, Carmelo and Capasso, Mario and Russo, Roberta and Andolfo, Immacolata and Iolascon, Achille and Carella, Massimo and Castori, Marco and Merla, Giuseppe and Aucella, Filippo and Raggi, Pamela and Marciano, Carmen and Perna, Rita and Bassetti, Matteo and Di Biagio, Antonio and Sanguinetti, Maurizio and Masucci, Luca and Gabbi, Chiara and Valente, Serafina and Guerrini, Susanna and Meloni, Ilaria and Mencarelli, Maria Antonietta and Rizzo, Caterina Lo and Bargagli, Elena and Mandalà, Marco and Giorli, Alessia and Salerni, Lorenzo and Fiorentino, Giuseppe and Zucchi, Patrizia and Parravicini, Pierpaolo and Menatti, Elisabetta and Baratti, Stefano and Trotta, Tullio and Giannattasio, Ferdinando and Coiro, Gabriella and Lena, Fabio and Coviello, Domenico A. and Mussini, Cristina and Renieri, Alessandra and Pinto, Anna Maria},
