  author = {Dand, Nick and Stuart, Philip E. and Bowes, John and Ellinghaus, David and Nititham, Joanne and Saklatvala, Jake R. and Teder-Laving, Maris and Thomas, Laurent F. and Traks, Tanel and Uebe, Steffen and Assmann, Gunter and Baudry, David and Behrens, Frank and Billi, Allison C. and Brown, Matthew A. and Burkhardt, Harald and Capon, Francesca and Chung, Raymond and Curtis, Charles J. and Duckworth, Michael and Ellinghaus, Eva and FitzGerald, Oliver and Gerdes, Sascha and Griffiths, Christopher E. M. and Gulliver, Susanne and Helliwell, Philip S. and Ho, Pauline and Hoffmann, Per and Holmen, Oddgeir L. and Huang, Zhi-ming and Hveem, Kristian and Jadon, Deepak and Köhm, Michaela and Kraus, Cornelia and Lamacchia, Céline and Lee, Sang Hyuck and Ma, Feiyang and Mahil, Satveer K. and McHugh, Neil and McManus, Ross and Modalsli, Ellen H. and Nissen, Michael J. and Nöthen, Markus and Oji, Vinzenz and Oksenberg, Jorge R. and Patrick, Matthew T. and Perez White, Bethany E. and Ramming, Andreas and Rech, Jürgen and Rosen, Cheryl and Sarkar, Mrinal K. and Schett, Georg and Schmidt, Börge and Tejasvi, Trilokraj and Traupe, Heiko and Voorhees, John J. and Wacker, Eike Matthias and Warren, Richard B. and Wasikowski, Rachael and Weidinger, Stephan and Wen, Xiaoquan and Zhang, Zhaolin and {BSTOP study group} and Burden, A. David and Smith, Catherine H. and Brown, Sara J. and Dand, Nick and Mahil, Satveer K. and McAteer, Helen and Schofield, Julia and Siebert, Stefan and {Estonian Biobank research team} and Metspalu, Andres and Milani, Lili and Nelis, Mari and Barton, Anne and Chandran, Vinod and Esko, Tõnu and Foerster, John and Franke, Andre and Gladman, Dafna D. and Gudjonsson, Johann E. and Gulliver, Wayne and Hüffmeier, Ulrike and Kingo, Külli and Kõks, Sulev and Liao, Wilson and Løset, Mari and Mägi, Reedik and Nair, Rajan P. and Rahman, Proton and Reis, André and Smith, Catherine H. and Di Meglio, Paola and Barker, Jonathan N. and Tsoi, Lam C. and Simpson, Michael A.