r, Thomas and Groop, Leif and Abecasis, Goncalo and Scott, Laura J. and Morris, Andrew P. and Kang, Hyun Min and Altshuler, David and Burtt, Noël P. and Florez, Jose C. and Boehnke, Michael and McCarthy, Mark I.},
  date = {2017-12-19},
