aron and Webster, Gwen and Wedderburn, Lucy R and Zelenovic, Jadranka and Birmingham, James D. and Elder, Melissa and Gottlieb, Beth S. and Ilowite, Normal T. and Imundo, Lisa F. and Kimura, Yukiko and Lokhnygina, Yuliya and Miller, Michael L. and Milojevic, Diana and O'Neil, Kathleen and Punaro, Marilynn G. and Prather, Kristi and Ruth, Natasha M. and Sandborg, Christy I. and Schanberg, Laura E. and Sherry, David D. and Singer, Nora G. and Spalding, Steven J. and Tarvin, Stacey E. and Verbsky, James W. and Wallace, Carol A. and Zemel, Lawrence S. and Burkle, Katrin and Cobb, Joanna and Etheridge, Angela and Gilbert, Paul and Hinks, Anne and Hirani, Shashi and Kassoumeri, Laura and Lal, Sham and Melville, Laura and Moncrieffe, Halima and Mulligan, Kathleen and Newman, Stanton and Patrick, Fiona and Southwood, Tauny and Thomson, Wendy and Ursu, Simona and Wedderburn, Lucy R and Whitworth, Pamela and Woo, Patricia and Baxter-Jones, Adam and Benseler, Susanne and Boire, Gilles and Cabral, David A. and Cameron, Bonnie and Campillo, Sarah and Chedeville, Gaëlle and Chetaille, Anne-Laure and Dancey, Paul and Duffy, Ciaran and Duffy, Karen Watanabe and Ellsworth, Janet and Feldman, Brian and Gibbon, Michele and Guillet, Chantal and Guzman, Jaime and Houghton, Kristin and Huber, Adam and Jurencak, Roman and Lang, Bianca and Laxer, Ronald and Maenz, Lynn and Matheson, Loren and Oen, Kiem and Petty, Ross and Ramsey, Suzanne and Rezaei, Elham and Rosenberg, Alan and Roth, Johannes and Schneider, Rayfel and Scuccimarri, Rosie and Silverman, Earl and Spiegel, Lynn and Stringer, Elizabeth and Tse, Shirley and Tucker, Lori B. and Turvey, Stuart and Yeung, Rae Sm},
  date = {2015-12-29},
  journaltitle = {Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences},
  shortjournal = {Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. U.S.A.},
  volume = {112},
