 Al Muhsen, Saleh and Al-Mulla, Fahd and Anderson, Mark S. and Arias, Andrés Augusto and Feldman, Hagit Baris and Bogunovic, Dusan and Bolze, Alexandre and Bondarenko, Anastasiia and Bousfiha, Ahmed A. and Brodin, Petter and Bryceson, Yenan and Bustamante, Carlos D. and Butte, Manish and Casari, Giorgio and Chakravorty, Samya and Christodoulou, John and Cirulli, Elizabeth and Condino-Neto, Antonio and Cooper, Megan A. and Dalgard, Clifton L. and David, Alessia and DeRisi, Joseph L. and Desai, Murkesh and Drolet, Beth A. and Espinosa, Sara and Fellay, Jacques and Flores, Carlos and Franco, Jose Luis and Gregersen, Peter K. and Haerynck, Filomeen and Hagin, David and Halwani, Rabih and Heath, Jim and Henrickson, Sarah E. and Hsieh, Elena and Imai, Kohsuke and Itan, Yuval and Karamitros, Timokratis and Kisand, Kai and Ku, Cheng-Lung and Lau, Yu-Lung and Ling, Yun and Lucas, Carrie L. and Maniatis, Tom and Mansouri, Davoud and Marodi, Laszlo and Meyts, Isabelle and Milner, Joshua and Mironska, Kristina and Mogensen, Trine and Morio, Tomohiro and Ng, Lisa F. P. and Notarangelo, Luigi D. and Novelli, Antonio and Novelli, Giuseppe and O’Farrelly, Cliona and Okada, Satoshi and Ozcelik, Tayfun and De Diego, Rebeca Perez and Planas, Anna M. and Prando, Carolina and Pujol, Aurora and Quintana-Murci, Lluis and Renia, Laurent and Renieri, Alessandra and Rodríguez-Gallego, Carlos and Sancho-Shimizu, Vanessa and Sankaran, Vijay and Barrett, Kelly Schiabor and Shahrooei, Mohammed and Snow, Andrew and Soler-Palacín, Pere and Spaan, András N. and Tangye, Stuart and Turvey, Stuart and Uddin, Furkan and Uddin, Mohammed J. and Van De Beek, Diederik and Vazquez, Sara E. and Vinh, Donald C. and Von Bernuth, Horst and Washington, Nicole and Zawadzki, Pawel and Su, Helen C. and Casanova, Jean-Laurent and Jing, Huie and Tung, Wesley and Luthers, Christopher R. and Bauman, Bradly M. and Shafer, Samantha and Zheng, Lixin and Zhang, Zinan and Kubo, Satoshi and Chauvin, Samuel D. and Meguro, Kaz